                "Gadolinia-Voe GV-HIL cathode puck on cell Gd-2 is 52 pps, fourfold the 12 pps "
                "quiet band. Rectifier CT remains 36 kA, 14 kA shy of the 50 kA trip. Legal action "
                "parks the 11 MW tap at zero; a current-first dispatch would energize a noisy "
                "cathode. Hall ammeters do not outrank the puck.",